''' Generated local entrance, collision and water data. No state ownership.
Module Smile.Tools.TownCatalogFeatures

Option Explicit

Import Smile.Simple3D.Precision3D As P
Import Smile.Simple3D.CameraClearance3D As Clearance

Public Type Box
